[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome to another great lesson with EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.6199999999999997, "end": 6.64}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 6.88, "end": 7.88}, {"text": "So, Erika, how are you today?", "start": 8.36, "end": 9.84}, {"text": "I'm doing pretty well, and I think we've got a good lesson today, a really helpful lesson.", "start": 10.06, "end": 14.66}, {"text": "What are we talking about today?", "start": 14.9, "end": 16.0}, {"text": "We have an elementary lesson about making an appointment.", "start": 16.16, "end": 20.0}, {"text": "Alright, making an appointment. Yeah, that's really helpful. I guess you have to make appointments for the doctor or...", "start": 20.32, "end": 26.46}, {"text": "At work, maybe.", "start": 26.46, "end": 27.46}, {"text": "At work, personal.", "start": 27.76, "end": 28.08}, {"text": "Or with your friends.", "start": 28.08, "end": 29.0}, {"text": "Yeah. So, this is language that you can use every day to make appointments.", "start": 29.0, "end": 33.16}, {"text": "Great. Well, so, why don't we take a look at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 33.6, "end": 38.26}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 39.14, "end": 40.36}, {"text": "We only have one word today, which you need to know to understand this dialogue, and it is financial advisor.", "start": 40.9, "end": 49.76}, {"text": "Financial advisor.", "start": 50.24, "end": 51.72}, {"text": "Financial advisor.", "start": 52.12, "end": 53.84}, {"text": "So, what is a financial advisor?", "start": 54.34, "end": 56.74}, {"text": "A financial advisor is a person who gives suggestions or recommendations about investing money.", "start": 56.74, "end": 65.9}, {"text": "Someone who wants you to put money in the stock market.", "start": 66.04, "end": 69.72}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 69.94, "end": 70.92}, {"text": "I guess we're ready now to listen to our dialogue for the first time.", "start": 70.92, "end": 73.98}, {"text": "And as always, it's going to be at a normal speed, but you don't have to worry about it because...", "start": 74.16, "end": 78.94}, {"text": "We'll come back and teach you all the important words.", "start": 78.94, "end": 82.0}, {"text": "Hello?", "start": 90.44, "end": 90.96}, {"text": "Fairbrook Consulting.", "start": 91.6, "end": 92.64}, {"text": "How may I help you?", "start": 92.8, "end": 93.6}, {"text": "Yes, this is Julianne Horton, and I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Miss McNeely.", "start": 94.06, "end": 98.54}, {"text": "Certainly. What day were you thinking of?", "start": 99.12, "end": 100.98}, {"text": "How's Thursday? Does she have any time available then?", "start": 101.3, "end": 103.9}, {"text": "Um, let me double check. Unfortunately, she's booked solid on Thursday. How does next Monday work for you?", "start": 103.9, "end": 110.04}, {"text": "Actually, I've got something scheduled on Monday. Can she do Tuesday?", "start": 110.5, "end": 113.74}, {"text": "Sure. Tuesday's perfect. May I ask where you're calling from?", "start": 114.4, "end": 118.2}, {"text": "Sure. Merton Financial Advisors.", "start": 118.52, "end": 120.66}, {"text": "Oh. Actually, Tuesday's no good. Sorry about that.", "start": 120.98, "end": 124.9}, {"text": "Well, I guess Miss McNeely does not want to speak to any financial advisors.", "start": 129.96, "end": 136.0}, {"text": "Yeah, I guess she doesn't really want to invest in the stock market, huh?", "start": 136.8, "end": 139.46}, {"text": "Or maybe she just gets too many phone calls from them.", "start": 139.48, "end": 142.02}, {"text": "Yeah, yeah. If you have money, I guess you'll get phone calls from people like that.", "start": 142.22, "end": 145.84}, {"text": "I guess we don't have that problem, hey?", "start": 145.96, "end": 147.58}, {"text": "No, we don't.", "start": 147.96, "end": 148.82}, {"text": "Okay, let's start with our language takeaway for today.", "start": 149.22, "end": 152.42}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 154.22, "end": 155.48}, {"text": "So, four words today. The first one is available.", "start": 156.70000000000002, "end": 160.98}, {"text": "Available.", "start": 161.70000000000002, "end": 162.36}, {"text": "Available.", "start": 162.6, "end": 163.16}, {"text": "Available.", "start": 163.72, "end": 164.38}, {"text": "Meaning?", "start": 164.72, "end": 165.0}, {"text": "That you are not busy.", "start": 165.56, "end": 167.58}, {"text": "That you're free.", "start": 167.78, "end": 168.32}, {"text": "You're free. You're not busy.", "start": 168.48, "end": 169.56}, {"text": "Exactly. Let's move to our next word.", "start": 169.8, "end": 171.94}, {"text": "Double check.", "start": 172.14, "end": 173.22}, {"text": "Double check.", "start": 173.56, "end": 174.44}, {"text": "Double check.", "start": 174.78, "end": 175.84}, {"text": "Double check.", "start": 176.44, "end": 177.32}, {"text": "I think we've got some examples of this phrase.", "start": 177.68, "end": 180.22}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 181.22, "end": 182.24}, {"text": "Do you have the tickets?", "start": 184.28, "end": 186.16}, {"text": "I think so, but let me just double check.", "start": 186.68, "end": 189.76}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 193.06, "end": 194.08}, {"text": "I thought I sent that email already, but let me double check.", "start": 197.18, "end": 202.48}, {"text": "Double check.", "start": 205.5, "end": 206.18}, {"text": "Okay, so double check basically means to check something twice.", "start": 206.18, "end": 209.88}, {"text": "Exactly. To check it again.", "start": 210.22, "end": 211.5}, {"text": "Check it again.", "start": 211.66, "end": 212.14}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 212.28, "end": 212.66}, {"text": "Our third word for language takeaway today is scheduled.", "start": 213.08, "end": 216.82}, {"text": "Scheduled.", "start": 217.76, "end": 218.44}, {"text": "Scheduled.", "start": 218.98, "end": 219.66}, {"text": "Scheduled.", "start": 220.16, "end": 220.84}, {"text": "Scheduled.", "start": 226.32, "end": 227.0}, {"text": "Scheduled.", "start": 227.0, "end": 227.02}, {"text": "So, when you have something scheduled, it means that you have something planned.", "start": 227.34, "end": 230.42}, {"text": "Planned, right?", "start": 230.8, "end": 231.38}, {"text": "Yeah, or booked at that time.", "start": 231.44, "end": 232.82}, {"text": "Booked at that time.", "start": 232.96, "end": 233.66}, {"text": "Yeah, we've got a lunch scheduled this afternoon, don't we?", "start": 233.68, "end": 237.52}, {"text": "Yes, we do.", "start": 237.72, "end": 238.5}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 238.72, "end": 239.02}, {"text": "Great lunch.", "start": 239.02, "end": 239.62}, {"text": "Looking forward to it.", "start": 239.84, "end": 240.7}, {"text": "And our last word for today is booked solid.", "start": 240.7, "end": 245.74}, {"text": "Booked solid.", "start": 246.06, "end": 247.42}, {"text": "Booked solid.", "start": 247.82, "end": 248.66}, {"text": "B-O-O-K-E-D.", "start": 248.94, "end": 250.6}, {"text": "Booked solid.", "start": 250.88, "end": 251.86}, {"text": "So, we have some great examples on how you can use this great phrase booked solid and you", "start": 252.24, "end": 257.08}, {"text": "can understand what it means.", "start": 257.08, "end": 258.36}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 259.18, "end": 260.26}, {"text": "I can't get a hotel room.", "start": 262.58, "end": 265.06}, {"text": "They're booked solid until after the new year.", "start": 265.22, "end": 267.72}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 271.42, "end": 272.34}, {"text": "I'm sorry, there are no seats available on this flight.", "start": 275.0, "end": 277.48}, {"text": "We're booked solid over the Christmas holidays.", "start": 277.74, "end": 279.7}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 283.14, "end": 284.12}, {"text": "Sorry, I can't meet with you today.", "start": 287.52, "end": 289.72}, {"text": "I'm booked solid.", "start": 290.26, "end": 291.16}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 294.7, "end": 295.48}, {"text": "So, booked solid basically is?", "start": 295.58, "end": 297.0}, {"text": "You have no free time, no available time.", "start": 297.16, "end": 300.68}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 301.04, "end": 301.48}, {"text": "So, you've got appointments scheduled all day.", "start": 301.8, "end": 304.78}, {"text": "All day.", "start": 304.94, "end": 305.24}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 305.34, "end": 305.58}, {"text": "So, with this in mind, now we can listen to our dialogue a second time.", "start": 306.06, "end": 309.9}, {"text": "This time, it's going to be slow so we can understand a little bit better.", "start": 310.1, "end": 313.82}, {"text": "Hello?", "start": 319.0, "end": 319.72}, {"text": "Fairbrook Consulting.", "start": 320.38, "end": 321.78}, {"text": "How may I help you?", "start": 322.0, "end": 323.3}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 323.7, "end": 324.32}, {"text": "This is Julianne Horton.", "start": 324.56, "end": 326.18}, {"text": "And I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.", "start": 326.28, "end": 330.58}, {"text": "Certainly.", "start": 331.18, "end": 331.9}, {"text": "What date were you thinking of?", "start": 332.34, "end": 334.22}, {"text": "How's Thursday?", "start": 334.56, "end": 335.76}, {"text": "Does she have any time available then?", "start": 335.76, "end": 339.24}, {"text": "Um, let me double check.", "start": 340.14, "end": 342.2}, {"text": "No.", "start": 342.72, "end": 343.38}, {"text": "Unfortunately, she's booked solid on Thursday.", "start": 343.82, "end": 346.64}, {"text": "How does next Monday work for you?", "start": 347.2, "end": 349.16}, {"text": "Actually, I've got something scheduled on Monday.", "start": 349.76, "end": 353.32}, {"text": "Can she do Tuesday?", "start": 353.32, "end": 355.5}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 356.38, "end": 356.88}, {"text": "Tuesday's perfect.", "start": 357.4, "end": 358.48}, {"text": "May I ask where you're calling from?", "start": 359.28, "end": 361.12}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 361.58, "end": 362.06}, {"text": "Merton Financial Advisors.", "start": 362.56, "end": 364.6}, {"text": "Oh.", "start": 365.2, "end": 365.64}, {"text": "Actually, Tuesday's no good.", "start": 367.64, "end": 369.4}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 369.72, "end": 370.68}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 373.84, "end": 374.52}, {"text": "So, now it's a little bit more clear.", "start": 374.52, "end": 376.4}, {"text": "And with this, we can start with putting it together.", "start": 376.4, "end": 379.16}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 381.34, "end": 382.56}, {"text": "There's some great examples in this dialogue of phrases you can use when you need to schedule", "start": 384.15999999999997, "end": 390.16}, {"text": "an appointment.", "start": 390.16, "end": 390.74}, {"text": "And we're going to look at those today.", "start": 390.94, "end": 392.92}, {"text": "In the dialogue, we heard Julianne ask about making an appointment.", "start": 393.18, "end": 398.38}, {"text": "And she said this.", "start": 398.38, "end": 399.78}, {"text": "I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.", "start": 400.24, "end": 404.18}, {"text": "I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.", "start": 406.02, "end": 410.06}, {"text": "So, this is a great way to schedule an appointment.", "start": 411.32, "end": 414.12}, {"text": "To ask for some time from somebody else.", "start": 414.12, "end": 417.26}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 417.5, "end": 417.64}, {"text": "And we have some more examples of this phrase.", "start": 417.8, "end": 420.22}, {"text": "Example 1.", "start": 421.5, "end": 422.44}, {"text": "Example 2.", "start": 427.78, "end": 428.66}, {"text": "Please schedule an appointment for next week.", "start": 430.28, "end": 432.46}, {"text": "", "start": 432.46, "end": 432.46}, {"text": "Please schedule an appointment for next week.", "start": 432.46, "end": 433.0}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 434.1, "end": 434.66}, {"text": "So, after that, when you're scheduling an appointment, you need to suggest a day when maybe that person", "start": 434.88, "end": 440.64}, {"text": "has time.", "start": 440.64, "end": 441.14}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 441.14, "end": 441.8}, {"text": "Let's listen to what they said in the dialogue.", "start": 442.14, "end": 443.98}, {"text": "How's Thursday?", "start": 445.78, "end": 446.64}, {"text": "Does she have any time available then?", "start": 446.92, "end": 448.34}, {"text": "How's Thursday?", "start": 450.58, "end": 451.48}, {"text": "Does she have any time available then?", "start": 451.7, "end": 453.16}, {"text": "You say, well, how's Thursday or how's Tuesday?", "start": 454.66, "end": 457.44}, {"text": "And maybe that person doesn't have time that day, so they'll say something like this.", "start": 457.84, "end": 461.84}, {"text": "Can't you do Tuesday?", "start": 462.74, "end": 463.92}, {"text": "Can't you do Tuesday?", "start": 465.74, "end": 466.94}, {"text": "Okay, Erica, so if I want to have a meeting with you, I would say, how's Monday sound?", "start": 468.28, "end": 473.64}, {"text": "Or how's Monday?", "start": 473.88, "end": 474.72}, {"text": "Monday's no good.", "start": 475.9, "end": 477.08}, {"text": "I'm busy all day.", "start": 477.42, "end": 478.8}, {"text": "How's Tuesday?", "start": 479.22, "end": 480.06}, {"text": "Sorry, Tuesday's no good either.", "start": 480.82, "end": 482.82}, {"text": "What about Wednesday?", "start": 483.18, "end": 484.36}, {"text": "Okay, Wednesday works.", "start": 484.8, "end": 486.32}, {"text": "All right, great.", "start": 486.52, "end": 487.24}, {"text": "Wednesday's perfect.", "start": 487.5, "end": 488.48}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 488.76, "end": 489.5}, {"text": "So we have a meeting on Wednesday.", "start": 489.5, "end": 491.24}, {"text": "Okay, yeah, those are some great phrases, hey, for scheduling an appointment.", "start": 491.24, "end": 494.62}, {"text": "Yeah, they're really good.", "start": 494.8, "end": 495.68}, {"text": "Okay, so now we can listen to our dialogue a third time and we're ready to understand everything that we've just talked about.", "start": 495.86, "end": 501.92}, {"text": "Hello, Fairbrook Consulting.", "start": 511.82000000000005, "end": 513.86}, {"text": "How may I help you?", "start": 514.0, "end": 514.82}, {"text": "Yes, this is Julianne Horton, and I'm calling to arrange an appointment with Ms. McNeely.", "start": 515.28, "end": 519.76}, {"text": "Certainly.", "start": 520.3199999999999, "end": 520.8}, {"text": "What day were you thinking of?", "start": 521.14, "end": 522.2}, {"text": "How's Thursday?", "start": 522.52, "end": 523.42}, {"text": "Does she have any time available then?", "start": 523.68, "end": 525.12}, {"text": "Um, let me double check.", "start": 525.5, "end": 526.6}, {"text": "Unfortunately, she's booked solid on Thursday.", "start": 527.92, "end": 529.78}, {"text": "How does next Monday work for you?", "start": 530.02, "end": 531.26}, {"text": "Actually, I've got something scheduled on Monday.", "start": 531.68, "end": 533.58}, {"text": "Can she do Tuesday?", "start": 534.04, "end": 534.96}, {"text": "Sure, Tuesday's perfect.", "start": 535.62, "end": 537.06}, {"text": "May I ask where you're calling from?", "start": 537.06, "end": 539.42}, {"text": "Sure.", "start": 539.76, "end": 540.12}, {"text": "Merton Financial Advisors.", "start": 540.44, "end": 541.88}, {"text": "Oh.", "start": 542.24, "end": 542.7}, {"text": "Actually, Tuesday's no good.", "start": 543.5, "end": 545.18}, {"text": "Sorry about that.", "start": 545.42, "end": 546.12}, {"text": "The language in this dialogue is really useful, isn't it, Marco?", "start": 552.8399999999999, "end": 555.9}, {"text": "Yeah, it's from an everyday situation.", "start": 556.2, "end": 558.3}, {"text": "You always have to make appointments at some point.", "start": 558.3, "end": 561.06}, {"text": "Yes, and like we said earlier, it's language you can use when you need to talk about work with your boss, maybe.", "start": 561.3, "end": 567.16}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 567.36, "end": 567.44}, {"text": "Or when you need to do daily things, like go to the doctor.", "start": 567.44, "end": 571.72}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 571.78, "end": 572.08}, {"text": "Or even when you're planning something with your friends.", "start": 572.22, "end": 574.38}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 574.58, "end": 574.74}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 574.98, "end": 575.1}, {"text": "You can use this in all those situations.", "start": 575.14, "end": 577.14}, {"text": "In all situations.", "start": 577.3, "end": 577.68}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 577.88, "end": 578.06}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 578.46, "end": 578.8}, {"text": "Well, we're out of time now, but I hope you enjoyed our lesson and found it useful.", "start": 578.96, "end": 582.46}, {"text": "And if you have any questions or comments, please go to our website at englishpod.com, where we'll be there to answer everything.", "start": 582.72, "end": 589.2}, {"text": "Yes, we will.", "start": 589.42, "end": 590.32}, {"text": "So, thanks for listening, guys.", "start": 590.6, "end": 591.76}, {"text": "And until next time, goodbye.", "start": 591.98, "end": 593.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 593.42, "end": 593.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 593.86, "end": 594.34}, {"text": "", "start": 594.66, "end": 594.66}, {"text": "", "start": 595.04, "end": 595.04}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 595.48, "end": 595.5}, {"text": "", "start": 595.8, "end": 595.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 596.04, "end": 596.66}, {"text": "", "start": 596.74, "end": 596.74}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 597.5, "end": 598.06}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 598.8, "end": 599.06}, {"text": "", "start": 600.62, "end": 600.62}, {"text": "", "start": 600.62, "end": 600.62}, {"text": "", "start": 600.62, "end": 600.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 600.62, "end": 600.68}, {"text": "", "start": 601.06, "end": 601.06}, {"text"